<title>USA: Battle Mountain Gold Q1 shr loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Battle Mountain Gold Q1 shr loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON, Texas 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Unaudited)</p>
<p>					  Three months ended</p>
<p>						March 31,</p>
<p>					    1997	  1996</p>
<p>Sales</p>
<p> Costs and expenses:	    $ 76,508    $104,996</p>
<p> Production costs		   51,138	59,030</p>
