<p>     and amortization	     16,418	20,812</p>
<p>Exploration, evaluation &amp;</p>
<p>    other lease costs		5,876	 9,171</p>
<p> Merger expense			2,193	    --</p>
<p>General and administrative</p>
<p>    expenses			   3,870	 3,875</p>
<p> Total costs and expenses	 79,495	92,888</p>
<p> Operating income (loss)	  (2,987)     12,108</p>
<p> Interest and other income	 1,367	   887</p>
<p> Interest expense		  (1,886)     (1,687)</p>
<p>Income before income taxes</p>
<p>    and minority interest	 (3,506)     11,308</p>
<p> Income-tax expense		  2,064	 3,871</p>
<p> Mining taxes			  1,579	 3,832</p>
<p>Minority interest in</p>
<p>    net (income) loss		  (45)	1,362</p>
