<p>					 229,652     234,688</p>
<p>		  (In thousands, except per-share data)</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Battle Mountain Gold Co.</p>
<p>The company noted a final merger-related expense of $2.2 million.</p>
<p>The company also said net income was impacted by lower average realized gold prices of $358 per gold ounce sold, compared with $398 in the first period of 1996, and lower gold production, which it expects to make up during the year.</p>
